14	// C ABI for the gfx_v2 on-device software fallback.
15	// The vortexpipe FS (NIR→LLVM, C) emits calls to these entry points when a unit
16	// is routed to software; the host builds the POD descriptors from the bound
17	// pipeline state and passes their resident device pointers via the kernel arg.
18	// The implementations (gfx_sw_abi.cpp) are thin wrappers over the C++ single-
19	// source-of-truth headers (gfx_frag_tex.h / gfx_sw.h / gfx_frag_rast.h), so the SW path
20	// the driver runs is bit-identical to the FF model and the unit tests.
21	//
22	// This header is plain C (no C++), so the C mesa driver can include it. The POD
23	// descriptors mirror gfx_sw::TexState / gfx_sw::om_state_t exactly; gfx_sw_abi.cpp
24	// static_asserts the layouts match.
